Make the device type of pairing a setting

The add-on pairs the account as "androidportable", which some subscriptions
do not include (https://github.com/palinek/pvr.sledovanitv.cz/issues/124);
"xbmc", "androidtv" and "ios" are accepted by the API as well. The default
stays "androidportable".

